[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009525921","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107995#issuecomment-3009525921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107995","id":3009525921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zYbih","user":{"login":"sinni800","id":2879097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzkwOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2879097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800","html_url":"https://github.com/sinni800","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T18:48:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T20:48:42Z","body":"In the `Godot v4.5.beta1` release it generates this:\n```\nfunc _on_text_edit_gui_input(event:  InputEvent) -> void:\n\tpass # Replace with function body.\n```\nNote the two spaces after `event:  InputEvent`. These are generated verbatim!\n\nIn `Godot v4.5.dev5` release it generates this:\n\n```\nfunc _on_text_edit_gui_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tpass # Replace with function body.\n```\n\nNot that after `event: InputEvent` there is only one space this time.\n\nIt seems that a variant of this issue started with the beta1 tag, though it wasn't debilitating at this point. \n\nEDIT: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/ee121ef80e36865ac9d5c55ab2ec419f48ef6954 introduced the \"two spaces\" issue. I don't yet know which commit introduced the messed up parameter definitions later.\n\nEDIT: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/a0a3a9c2fca0df20b907ac8d37280612a0a4ef73 is still \"two spaces\" so it must be after that.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009525921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009732298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107995#issuecomment-3009732298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107995","id":3009732298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zZN7K","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T19:40:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T19:40:36Z","body":"CC @dalexeev ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/iss